    "You're in control": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tienes el control"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents can use it now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus agentes ya pueden usarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents see what you connect here. Nothing leaves your own Hermes, and nothing is added to your calendar unless you tap Add.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus agentes ven lo que conectes aquí. Nada sale de tu Hermes, y no se añade nada a tu calendario salvo que toques Añadir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents stop using it. You can connect it again at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus agentes dejan de usarlo. Puedes volver a conectarlo cuando quieras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your calendar": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu calendario"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your events are deleted from your Hermes and your agents stop seeing them. Calendar access for Alice stays in iOS Settings until you turn it off there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus eventos se borran de tu Hermes y tus agentes dejan de verlos. El acceso de Alice al calendario sigue en los Ajustes de iOS hasta que lo quites allí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone's calendar and every connector Hermes offers — Notion, Linear, Figma and more — to connect or disconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El calendario de tu iPhone y todos los conectores que ofrece Hermes (Notion, Linear, Figma y más) para conectarlos o desconectarlos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
